{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47913","headline":"霅溪夜宴诗 十 · 水神","name":"霅溪夜宴诗 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行殿秋未晚，水宫风初凉。\n谁言此中夜，得接朝宗行。\n灵鼍振冬冬，神龙耀煌煌。\n红楼压波起，翠幄连云张。\n玉箫冷吟秋，瑶瑟清含商。\n贤臻江湖叟，贵列川渎王。\n谅予衰俗人，无能振颓纲。\n分辞皆乱世，乐寐蛟螭乡。\n栖迟幽岛间，几见波成桑。\n尔来尽流俗，难与倾壶觞。\n今日登华筵，稍觉神扬扬。\n方欢沧浪侣，遽恐白日光。\n海人瑞锦前，岂敢言文章。\n聊歌灵境会，此会诚难忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"水神","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}